    "Adds a [mcp_servers.sidefolk] entry to ~/.codex/config.toml, so Codex can use Sidefolk's tools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يضيف الإدخال [mcp_servers.sidefolk] إلى ~/.codex/config.toml حتى يتمكن Codex من استخدام أدوات Sidefolk."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fügt ~/.codex/config.toml einen Eintrag [mcp_servers.sidefolk] hinzu, damit Codex die Werkzeuge von Sidefolk nutzen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade una entrada [mcp_servers.sidefolk] a ~/.codex/config.toml para que Codex pueda usar las herramientas de Sidefolk."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoute une entrée [mcp_servers.sidefolk] à ~/.codex/config.toml, pour que Codex puisse utiliser les outils de Sidefolk."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiunge una voce [mcp_servers.sidefolk] a ~/.codex/config.toml, così Codex può usare gli strumenti di Sidefolk."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.codex/config.tomlに[mcp_servers.sidefolk]の項目を追加し、CodexがSidefolkのツールを使えるようにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.codex/config.toml에 [mcp_servers.sidefolk] 항목을 추가해서 Codex가 Sidefolk의 도구를 쓸 수 있게 해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adiciona uma entrada [mcp_servers.sidefolk] em ~/.codex/config.toml, para que o Codex possa usar as ferramentas do Sidefolk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ~/.codex/config.toml 中添加 [mcp_servers.sidefolk] 条目，让 Codex 可以使用 Sidefolk 的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a link at ~/.local/bin/sidefolk so you can type “sidefolk run -- npm test” in a terminal. Nothing else changes. If ~/.local/bin isn't on your PATH, add this line to ~/.zshrc:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يضيف رابطًا في ~/.local/bin/sidefolk لتتمكن من كتابة «sidefolk run -- npm test» في Terminal. لا يتغيّر شيء آخر. إذا لم يكن ~/.local/bin ضمن PATH لديك، فأضف هذا السطر إلى ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legt unter ~/.local/bin/sidefolk einen Link an, damit du „sidefolk run -- npm test“ im Terminal eingeben kannst. Sonst ändert sich nichts. Wenn ~/.local/bin nicht in deinem PATH ist, füge diese Zeile zu ~/.zshrc hinzu:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade un enlace en ~/.local/bin/sidefolk para que puedas escribir “sidefolk run -- npm test” en un terminal. No cambia nada más. Si ~/.local/bin no está en tu PATH, añade esta línea a ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoute un lien dans ~/.local/bin/sidefolk pour que vous puissiez taper « sidefolk run -- npm test » dans un terminal. Rien d’autre ne change. Si ~/.local/bin n’est pas dans votre PATH, ajoutez cette ligne à ~/.zshrc :"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiunge un link in ~/.local/bin/sidefolk, così puoi digitare “sidefolk run -- npm test” in un terminale. Nient'altro cambia. Se ~/.local/bin non è nel tuo PATH, aggiungi questa riga a ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.local/bin/sidefolkにリンクを追加し、ターミナルで「sidefolk run -- npm test」と入力できるようにします。ほかには何も変更しません。~/.local/binがPATHに含まれていない場合は、次の行を~/.zshrcに追加してください："
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.local/bin/sidefolk에 링크를 추가해서 터미널에서 “sidefolk run -- npm test”를 입력할 수 있게 해요. 다른 것은 바뀌지 않아요. ~/.local/bin이 PATH에 없으면 ~/.zshrc에 다음 줄을 추가하세요:"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adiciona um link em ~/.local/bin/sidefolk para você digitar “sidefolk run -- npm test” num terminal. Nada mais muda. Se ~/.local/bin não estiver no seu PATH, adicione esta linha ao ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ~/.local/bin/sidefolk 添加一个链接，这样你就可以在终端里输入“sidefolk run -- npm test”。其他都不会改变。如果 ~/.local/bin 不在你的 PATH 中，请把下面这一行添加到 ~/.zshrc："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a “sidefolk” MCP server to ~/.claude.json, so Claude Code can save notes, set reminders, watch and notify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يضيف خادم MCP باسم «sidefolk» إلى ~/.claude.json حتى يتمكن Claude Code من حفظ الملاحظات وضبط التذكيرات والمراقبة والإشعار."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fügt ~/.claude.json einen MCP-Server „sidefolk“ hinzu, damit Claude Code Notizen speichern, Erinnerungen erstellen, Dinge beobachten und dich benachrichtigen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade un servidor MCP “sidefolk” a ~/.claude.json para que Claude Code pueda guardar notas, crear recordatorios, vigilar y avisarte."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoute un serveur MCP « sidefolk » à ~/.claude.json, pour que Claude Code puisse enregistrer des notes, créer des rappels, surveiller et envoyer des notifications."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiunge un server MCP “sidefolk” a ~/.claude.json, così Claude Code può salvare note, impostare promemoria, tenere d'occhio le cose e inviare notifiche."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.claude.jsonに「sidefolk」MCPサーバを追加し、Claude Codeがメモの保存、リマインダーの設定、監視、通知を行えるようにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.claude.json에 “sidefolk” MCP 서버를 추가해서 Claude Code가 메모를 저장하고, 미리 알림을 설정하고, 지켜보고, 알릴 수 있게 해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adiciona um servidor MCP “sidefolk” ao ~/.claude.json, para que o Claude Code possa salvar notas, criar lembretes, monitorar e notificar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ~/.claude.json 中添加“sidefolk”MCP 服务器，让 Claude Code 可以保存笔记、设置提醒、监视和发送通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds hooks for %@ that run %@ hook (%lld s limit)." : {
