    "I'll add myself to Claude Code and Codex. You'll see exactly what changes, and I keep a backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سأضيف نفسي إلى Claude Code وCodex. سترى بالضبط ما يتغيّر، وأحتفظ بنسخة احتياطية."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ich trage mich bei Claude Code und Codex ein. Du siehst genau, was sich ändert, und ich lege eine Sicherung an."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Me añadiré a Claude Code y a Codex. Verás exactamente qué cambia, y guardaré una copia de seguridad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je vais m’ajouter à Claude Code et à Codex. Vous verrez exactement ce qui change, et je garde une sauvegarde."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mi aggiungerò a Claude Code e Codex. Vedrai esattamente cosa cambia, e conservo un backup."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude CodeとCodexにSidefolkを追加します。変更内容はすべて確認でき、バックアップも残します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code와 Codex에 저를 추가할게요. 무엇이 바뀌는지 정확히 보여 드리고 백업도 해 둘게요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vou me adicionar ao Claude Code e ao Codex. Você vai ver exatamente o que muda, e eu guardo um backup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我会把自己添加到 Claude Code 和 Codex 中。你会看到具体改了什么，我也会保留备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
